  "description": "Plugin contract for OutWit log query providers. Defines ILogProviderPlugin (a marker over IWitPlugin) so a host can load NewRelic / Loki / file-scanning log backends via WitPluginLoader. Also defines HostLoggingInfo — a documented side-channel that lets file-scanning plugins discover the host's log directory without duplicating Serilog config.",
